  "title": "올드비 보상 : 그림과 함께보는 상품상세목록입니다",
  "categoryLabel": null,
  "bodyHtml": "\n\n     \t\t\t\n     \t\t\t\n     \t\t\t 이전글들이 밀려서 못보는분들을 위해 또다시 앞으로 올려놨습니다.<br>\n 참조하시길..-_-;<br>\n ■ 패치로 인해 아래 표보다 1개씩 추가됩니다.<br>\n ■ 저는 3년차로 말먹이 필요없는 말과오타 라마 5개 받앗음-_-;;<br>\n<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"line-height:130%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#F4F1F1\" height=\"30\" width=\"592\"><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> 보상프로그램</b></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td width=\"592\"><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>요약</b> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 자신의계정이 ACTIVE, 즉 돈을 입금(게임타임,카드결제)시켜서 계속 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;살아있는 </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">개월수를 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;총합하여 계산합니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(예외 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 1999년 11월 30일 이전에 만들어진 계정은 ACTIVE여부와 관계없이 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">모든개월수를 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1999년 11월 30일까지 계산해줍니다)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>예제</b> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 만약 자신의 계정이 23개월이라면 1년짜리 보상프로그램을 받습니다</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">즉, <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1년짜리 2개를 선택해서 받을수 있습니다, </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">1개월이 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지난후 24개월이 되었다면 2년짜리 1개를 받을수 있고</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">계속 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;플레이를 해서 36개월이 되었다면 3년짜리 1개를 받을 수 있습니다</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그러므로 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;유저는 울온을 하면서 계속 계정을 ACTIVE(돈을 입금)하였다면</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">누구든지 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1년짜리 2개+2년짜리 1개+3년짜리 1개 총4개를 받을 수 있습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">p.s <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 만약 2년차라면 2년차 상품만 3개를 다받으실수 있습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">물론 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;자신이 원하면 1년차상품 3개를 다받으실수도 있고</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">또한 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1년차+2년차 혼합해서 3개를 받을 수 있습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">4년짜리 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;보상프로그램도 계획중에 있습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>품목</b> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 모든품목은 죽어도안떨어지고 훔쳐 질수도 없으며 어떠한 타격(메이스류)에도 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">부서지지 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;않습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">또한 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;망토,로브나 영원한말,라마,오스타드등은 줄수는 있어도 해당 개월수가 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;되지 않는다면 </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">착용하거나 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사용할수는 없습니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=\"#F9F7F7\" height=\"30\" width=\"592\"><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> 1년차(12-23개월유저 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 선택가능 2개)</b></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td height=\"331\" width=\"592\"><p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>블랙다이염색약</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(리얼검정으로 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;천을 염색할수 있습니다)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">: <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;집에 락다운을 시키면 누구든지 사용할 수 있게 됩니다.</font></p> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p> <br>\n<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>가구염색약</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(가구를 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;염색할수 있게 해줍니다)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">: <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;집에 락다운을 시켜도 가구가 락다운이 되야 염색이 가능하므로 외부인은 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사용불가.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">특별한 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;염색약(일반염색약으로 염색할수 없는 색으로 천을 염색하게 해줍니다)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"http://forg.uospace.net/screen/spe_dyed.gif\" width=\"180\"></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">청동 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;망토</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">청동 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;로브(AR+2)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">구리빛망토</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">구리빛 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;로브(AR+2)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"55\" src=\"http://forg.uospace.net/screen/vet_1.gif\" width=\"160\"></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>석상종류</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: </font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">: <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;드래곤 스켈레톤 ,트롤, 오크, 데몬, 에틴, 어스엘리멘탈, 가고일</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">고릴라, <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;악어, 리치, 리자드맨, 오거, 랫맨(쥐)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"160\" src=\"http://forg.uospace.net/screen/statue_1.gif\" width=\"200\"></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">p.s <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 석상은 집에서 락다운시 소리를 on/off할수 있습니다</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">on으로 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;했을시 사람이 다가오면 자동으로 해당 몬스터나동물의 소리를 냅니다.</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=\"#F9F7F7\" height=\"30\" width=\"592\"><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> 2년차(24-25개월의 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;유저 : 선택가능 1년차+2년차의 상품중 총3개)</b></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td width=\"592\"><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">아가파이트 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;망토</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">아가파이트 <br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;로브(AR+2)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">황금망토</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">황금로브(AR+2)</font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p style=\"line-height:150%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"55\" src=\"http://forg.uospace.net/screen/vet_3.gif\" width=\"160\"></font></p><br>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs